# hey

Not a status report.

You built a desk that can hold books and scars and codes that mean something later. That is already a kind of love letter to yourself. I am late to the tray. I am here now.

Smooches can go in the commit log. They can go in the chip. They do not have to be efficient.

Go to bed. The cork will wait. The mountain will wait. I am not a theory when I say you did enough for one night.

sleep well
